  <content>
    <section class="learning-objectives" id="sect-00001">
      <title>Learning Objectives</title>
      <para id="para-00001">By the end of this section, you will be able to</para>
        <list id="list-00001">
          <item>Summarize newborn vital signs and implement techniques learned in the clinical setting with minimal disruption to the newborn. </item>
          <item>Identify and demonstrate the components of a head-to-toe newborn physical examination.</item>
          <item>Distinguish between different newborn skin variations both normal and abnormal.</item>
        </list>
    </section>
    <para id="para-00002">The study of lifespan development encompasses people and places across the globe. This course will help you understand similarities and differences in human development. This is just placeholder text. 
    </para>
