      <para id="para-00033">
        It is common to see the careers of many professional athletes end by their early thirties yet we see notable athlete continue playing to age 40 and beyond. As discussed in this section a number of subtle changes occur physically that can make continued playing difficult. Reaction times are not quite as quick as their younger counter parts.
      </para>
